{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33835","headline":"奉和鲁望樵人十咏 樵火 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望樵人十咏 樵火","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山客地炉里，然薪如阳辉。\n松膏作𣺫瀡，杉子爲珠玑\n响误击刺闹，焰疑彗孛飞。\n傍边煖白酒，不觉瀑冰垂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33835.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33835","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}